12. ACCEPTANCE CHECKS
════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
· Loads with EARTH featured, VENUS left, MARS right. Only the Earth clip has a src.
· Clicking a side planet swaps the visible cut-out in the SAME FRAME (measurable at
